                                "sense_id": "cd5f7b06-11cb-3745-95ec-d44ea0a5b67a",
                                "text": "On weeknights other than Saturdays, the last Bedford train leaves St. Pancras at 10.35 instead of 10.0 p.m. and is 20 min. faster, and the last Luton train at 11.35 instead of 11.15 p.m."
                            },
